<title>USA: MAPCO unit to buy full ownership of Lexas.</title>
<headline>MAPCO unit to buy full ownership of Lexas.</headline>
<dateline>TULSA, Okla. 1997-07-09</dateline>
<text>
<p>MAPCO Inc said Wednesday its MAPCO Petroleum Inc unit agreed to take full ownership of Lexas Oil LLC.</p>
<p>The company said MAPCO Petroleum owned 50 percent of Lexas since January 1995.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
</text>
